<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.route.unbinds ~ one route leaves; a rotation moves the key in the same act

`lares vault unbind <slot-id>` removes one slot from the vessel key's tree (`--face N`: from that face's tree) once the hand proves a route that opens it; `--rotate` moves the key itself in the same act, so the slot that leaves opens nothing ever again. Slot ids print under `lares vault status`. A credential rides a TTY alone: no flag, no environment variable and no pipe carries one, nothing echoes one, and it drops the instant the act returns. Rotation never repairs the loss of a relation carrier.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ unbind · rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`unbind` params=`slot-id/s2 ~ remove slot s2 from the vessel key`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`rotate` params=`slot-id/s2 rotate/true ~ remove slot s2 and rotate the key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slot-id · face · rotate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slot-id` params=`takes/slot needs/required seat/1 as/<slot-id> ~ the slot that leaves, as vault status names it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ unbind from that face's own tree, by persona index`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rotate` params=`~ move the key itself in the same act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/route ~ a person types the route at their own terminal; an AI seat names the command`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · face-not-named · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.custody.reads]] ~ no slot id, no such slot, a tree that does not read, or a typed route that opens nothing; read the slots`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-not-named` params=`~ no face of that index stands in the floor index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the custody door's named refusals lead the line by class (OccupiedStoreRefusal, CustodyRefusal, TreeKeyRefusal, CensusRefusal, CustodyLockRefused, CustodyFoundingRefused, CredentialTtyRefusal, RotationSlotsRefused), exit 1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ unbound

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`unbound` params=`exit/0 fields/[[slotId rotated slots]] ~ the slot left; rotated names whether the key moved`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

